#   bg     #073642  base02
#   bg_hl  #0e414e  base02 lightened one step (CursorLine / Visual)
#   dim    #586e74  comments, line numbers
#   fg     #91a0a2  midpoint of osaka base0 and solarized base0
#   bright #91a0a2  same as fg
